# ElevenLabs API Key for Dynamic Speech Narration (Optional)
# If provided, dynamic questions will be narrated via ElevenLabs Alice voice (eleven_multilingual_v2).
# If omitted, pre-generated audio files in /assets/audio/ will still play, and dynamic speech is silently skipped without robotic fallback.
VITE_ELEVENLABS_API_KEY=your_elevenlabs_api_key_here
